    "title": "Felony Charges Dismissed Against Burlington Nurse Accused of Stealing Medication - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Allison Jacobs ,\n11 hours ago A judge has dismissed felony criminal charges against a Burlington nurse accused of stealing pain medication from residents at a Southeast Iowa nursing home. Thirty-year-old Ashley Bessine had been charged in December of 2025 with four felony counts involving controlled substances, along with charges of tampering with records and dependent adult abuse. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
